{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49391","headline":"临江仙 · 毛文锡","name":"临江仙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暮蝉声尽落斜阳，银蟾影挂潇湘。\n黄陵庙侧水茫茫，楚山红树，烟雨隔高唐。\n岸泊渔灯风颭碎，白苹远散浓香。\n灵娥鼓瑟韵清商，朱弦凄切，云散碧天长。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"毛文锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49391.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49391","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}